#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:1
#: 72e66e035e7c47fb903896d5b5b59f82
msgid "VLA collect / train / deploy"
msgstr "VLA 采训推"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:3
#: e5c49bcfa01c43c5872cddcb8b310be6
msgid ""
"For teams that collect motion data (VR or sim), then train and deploy a "
"VLA-style policy. This page is a **collection and stack** path. Training "
"and policy serving are not documented here yet."
msgstr "面向先采集运动数据（VR 或仿真）、再训练并部署 VLA 类策略的团队。本页是 **采集与栈** 路径。训练和策略推理服务尚未成文。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:5
#: fe593c3a965e40f2b65141801329c6d6
msgid "1. Collect with VR teleop"
msgstr "1. 用 VR 遥操作采集"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:7
#: 7cd01a14e08e41fbb523020ad5bd0485
msgid ""
"Bring up the robot (mock, sim, or real) from [Go to Real "
"Hardware](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md) or [Run"
" Mock Demo](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md)."
msgstr ""
"从[部署到真实机器人](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md)或[运行 "
"Mock "
"演示](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md)拉起机器人（mock、仿真或真机）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:8
#: 59cd236cf87942a88a675562c7f318ac
msgid ""
"[VR Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) — `./run.sh vr` "
"or `./run.sh vr-xrt` from [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md)."
msgstr ""
"[VR 遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md) — 在 [fa-py-"
"libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md) 中执行 `./run.sh"
" vr` 或 `./run.sh vr-xrt`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:9
#: 24959a256b5d4e518da853510c0f2ef2
msgid ""
"Optional bags: the fa-py-libraries README lists `./run.sh vr-record` / "
"`./run.sh vr-playback` for `/teleop/*`."
msgstr ""
"可选 bag：fa-py-libraries README 列出了针对 `/teleop/*` 的 `./run.sh vr-record` / "
"`./run.sh vr-playback`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:11
#: 665728ecf5bc4c4c83d78879c7cb60bd
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer stays on the VR how-to."
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版的说明仍在 VR 操作指南。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:13
#: 288210a46ac849048992344e2fe29cdb
msgid "2. Whole-body control with waist"
msgstr "2. 带腰部的全身控制"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:15
#: 568098f040404efaa7581353a8d19de3
msgid ""
"Whole-body here is **全身控制** (`full_body.launch.py` / Lift 2S **full "
"body**), not a separate waist-only product."
msgstr "这里的全身控制就是 **全身控制**（`full_body.launch.py` / Lift 2S **全身**），不是单独的仅腰部产品。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:17
#: 2eca62f6972340c8b7de93055b96ce98
msgid ""
"[分体控制 vs 全身控制](../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md) — `split_body.launch.py` "
"vs `full_body.launch.py`."
msgstr ""
"[分体控制 vs 全身控制](../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md) — `split_body.launch.py` "
"与 `full_body.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:18
#: 56ca205b56df4da2a0372f9895081326
msgid ""
"[ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) — "
"`./quick_start.sh` menu: **full body**."
msgstr ""
"[方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) — "
"`./quick_start.sh` 菜单选 **全身**。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:19
#: 23cd265f52a846dd8a7baac9154f7130
msgid ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md) — private"
" submodule; public loader is `full_body.launch.py`. Topics and FSM "
"values: that package README after access."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md) — "
"私有子模块；公开加载入口是 `full_body.launch.py`。话题和状态机取值：开通后见该包 README。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:20
#: 7fe6678cf44348228ca902427bf615af
msgid ""
"Waist **joint** commands on the 分体 / Basic Joint Controller side: [Basic "
"Joint Controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" (`waist_lifting_*`, `waist_turning_command`). How-to: [Use Basic Joint "
"Controller](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)."
msgstr ""
"分体 / Basic Joint Controller 一侧的腰部 **关节** 命令：[Basic Joint "
"Controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)（`waist_lifting_*`、`waist_turning_command`）。操作指南：[使用"
" Basic Joint Controller](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:22
#: e50ad3a74f0a47e3a9b88e1c7836a644
msgid ""
"Internal FA wheeled-arm humanoids: [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md) after access."
msgstr "内部 FA 轮臂人形：开通后见 [fa-deploy-ws 配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:24
#: 4c4c2cd398e948fab101d42055287977
msgid "3. Arm force control and load identification"
msgstr "3. 机械臂力控与负载辨识"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:26
#: a43c11b15e284928b04271ca8a59f541
msgid ""
"VR teleop uses **two** compliance paths — pick by robot: [VR "
"Teleoperation — Force control and "
"compliance](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"VR 遥操作有**两条**柔顺路径 — 按机型选择：[VR 遥操作 — "
"力控与柔顺](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:28
#: 537d255df8ee423db52824f6b50857d4
msgid ""
"**MIT / force-capable HI** — **Panthera HT** and **ARX** arms: HT "
"`control_mode:=mit`, ARX `full_control` + `joint_k_gains` / "
"`joint_d_gains`. Controller MIX: "
"[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"**MIT / 带力控 HI** — **Panthera HT** 与 **方舟无限** 机械臂：HT "
"`control_mode:=mit`，方舟无限 `full_control` + `joint_k_gains` / "
"`joint_d_gains`。控制器 "
"MIX：[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:29
#: a503ade5a2b74643b7681f1f9b59fd1c
msgid ""
"**Vendor joint impedance** — **Tianji** (天玑) / **Rokae** (珞石): controller"
" sends **position** only; HI `ctrl_mode` `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` on [marvin-"
"ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"**厂商关节阻抗** — **天玑** / **珞石**：控制器只发**位置**；HI `ctrl_mode` 为 "
"`JOINT_IMPEDANCE`，见 [marvin-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:31
#: 21f1c111523c4602889bd97ef67a3a94
msgid ""
"**Payload identification (负载辨识)** is on the Tianji / Rokae path only. "
"Public wizard: `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`. "
"Internal on-site flow: [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md) README after access."
msgstr ""
"**负载辨识**只在天玑 / 珞石路径上。公开向导：`ros2 run marvin_ros2_control "
"tool_dyn_identify_wizard`。内部现场流程：开通后见 [fa-deploy-ws "
"配置](../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md) README。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:33
#: d5e1bc2bd01f4b529021d4394e18829b
msgid ""
"Isomorphic HT `mode:=mit` / `effort` is a different page: [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"同构 HT 的 `mode:=mit` / `effort` "
"是另一页：[同构遥操作](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

