"Isaac USD → 接口 → composer → LeRobot "
"**录制/导出**（不是训练）：[合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/3-vla_collect_train_deploy.md:39
